  "excerpt": "出家在家喻\n 淨土宗編輯部\n\n    出家者，如鷹擊長空；\n    在家者，如孔雀拖尾。\n    出家者，如鯤鵬展翅；\n    在家者，如鵪竄草叢。\n    出家者，如龍游大海；\n    在家者，如蝦在牛跡。\n    出",
  "bodyHtml": "<div><!--HTML編輯器或是圖文區塊套用此ID--> <h2>出家在家喻</h2> <div>淨土宗編輯部<br /><br /> <p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"color:#000080\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>出家者，如鷹擊長空；</strong></span></span></span></p> <p><span style=\"color:#000080\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;在家者，如孔雀拖尾。</strong></span></span></span></p> <p><span style=\"color:#000080\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;出家者，如鯤鵬展翅；</strong></span></span></span></p> <p><span style=\"color:#000080\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;在家者，如鵪竄草叢。</strong></span></span></span></p> <p><span style=\"color:#000080\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;出家者，如龍游大海；</strong></span></span></span></p> <p><span style=\"color:#000080\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;在家者，如蝦在牛跡。</strong></span></span></span></p> <p><span style=\"color:#000080\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;出家無憂，如鳥歸山林；</strong></span></span></span></p> <p><span style=\"color:#000080\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;在家逼迫，如熱鍋螞蟻</strong></span>。</span></span></p> <p>《走好出家路》</p> </div> </div>",
